@ApiService_HostAddress = http://localhost:5344

### Health check (Development only)
GET {{ApiService_HostAddress}}/health

### ArchitectureAgent: single specialist (Chat Completions)
POST {{ApiService_HostAddress}}/agents/architecture/v1/chat/completions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "ArchitectureAgent",
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Migrate our monolithic e-commerce platform to microservices on AKS with an event-driven backbone on Azure Service Bus, a separate PostgreSQL database per service, and a single Azure Front Door entry point across two regions."
    }
  ]
}

### ArchitectureReviewBoard: ReviewPanel (4 specialists) -> SynthesisAgent (Chat Completions)
POST {{ApiService_HostAddress}}/agents/review-board/v1/chat/completions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "ArchitectureReviewBoard",
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Migrate our monolithic e-commerce platform to microservices on AKS with an event-driven backbone on Azure Service Bus, a separate PostgreSQL database per service, and a single Azure Front Door entry point across two regions."
    }
  ]
}

### ArchitectureReviewBoard: streaming
POST {{ApiService_HostAddress}}/agents/review-board/v1/chat/completions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "ArchitectureReviewBoard",
  "stream": true,
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Migrate our monolithic e-commerce platform to microservices on AKS with an event-driven backbone on Azure Service Bus, a separate PostgreSQL database per service, and a single Azure Front Door entry point across two regions."
    }
  ]
}

###